  m_Name: DialogueName
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: DialogueName
  <Text>k__BackingField: Start the quest to retrieve the wind crystal. Give the player
    the sky engine piece to fix it. Require the player to fix the sky engine, fuel
    it, and kill some bats as well, then get the wind crystal. Mattie will remind
    the player of the task after the quest is started, and then thank the player
    after the quest is done, and should tell the player to see Hattie about what
    to do with the wind crystal, if that hasn't been done already.
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Next Dialogue
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
